  "_module_contract": {
    "_comment": "Every module (ESGRC, Brand, Audit, Policy, etc.) follows this 5-step contract. ScriptRunner is module-agnostic - it reads only pipeline and script_name. To add a new module: add a new top-level key here with steps matching this contract. Zero ScriptRunner changes needed.",
